Why this licence

The Factory map geometry in src/data/map-factory.json is derived from
the-hideout/tarkov-dev-svg-maps, which is published under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
That licence is share-alike, so this project — code, data and all — is
released under the same terms.

You are free to share and adapt this work for non-commercial purposes,
provided you give attribution and license your derivative under the same
terms.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Third-party material

  Factory map geometry
    the-hideout/tarkov-dev-svg-maps
    https://github.com/the-hideout/tarkov-dev-svg-maps
    CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

  Item artwork (assets/items/*.webp)
    assets.tarkov.dev, from the community tarkov.dev project
    https://tarkov.dev

  Trader portraits (assets/traders/*.png)
    Escape From Tarkov wiki

  Item templates, names, descriptions, handbook prices
    SPT database dumps
    https://github.com/sp-tarkov/server

  Sound effects (assets/sfx-eft/pack.bin)
    Third-party audio, sealed with tools/pack_sfx.py. All rights remain with
    their owner. NOT covered by the licence above and NOT licensed for
    redistribution. It ships encrypted; the key is present only because the
    page must have it in order to play the game.

Escape From Tarkov is a trademark of Battlestate Games. This is a
non-commercial fan project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by Battlestate Games.

