Disclaimer

The CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 grant above covers only the parts of this project its
authors made. It does not - and cannot - license the third-party material
listed above, whose rights stay with their respective owners.

assets/sfx-eft/pack.bin is encrypted precisely because its contents are not
ours to hand out. The passphrase appears in the source for one reason only:
a static page cannot play the audio without it. That is not permission to use
it for anything else. Unsealing the pack to get at the audio inside is a
deliberate act taken against the intent of the seal, and nothing here should be
read as consent to it. Whoever does it, and whoever then copies, publishes,
redistributes or builds on what comes out, does so on their own initiative and
carries the consequences alone.

The same holds for the project as a whole. If you copy, fork, mirror, host,
repackage, transcode or otherwise further process this repository or anything
